WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
Today on a fresh profile. Nothing is planned yet, so nothing is demanding attention.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:10.400
The Inbox holds three fictional items. A new thought goes straight into quick capture.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.800
It lands in the Inbox as a note. The next action does not change.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:18.300
The user classifies it as a reminder.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:24.700
Organize with B.O.B. proposes one change and shows it first. Nothing changes until it is approved.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.000
Apply this change. Today shows the bike-shop email as the next action, and everything else stayed put.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.400
Do it now marks the task as in progress.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:34.000
In Chat, local B.O.B. guidance is active. Prompts are not sent to OpenRouter.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.700
Break it down suggests a smaller first step.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:43.900
Save my place stores the objective, its state and the next step in B.O.B.'s local state.

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:47.300
B.O.B. is closed and reopened. Today still shows the task in progress.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:52.700
The saved handoff is still in Chat, ready to resume.

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:56.700
Settings. Optional inference providers are off by default: no OpenRouter key, and cloud and billed use unchecked.

00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:00.466
Accessibility settings offer larger text and reduced motion, and your data can be exported.
